@startuml
!include <archimate/Archimate>

title Application Integration v16 — 多入口同源 API (2026-07-11 17:26)

legend right
  | <#LightGreen>  </> | 🟢 [NEW] v16 — 本次新增 |
  | <#LightYellow> </> | 🟡 [MODIFIED] v16 — 本次修改 |
  | <#LightPink>   </> | 🔴 [DEPRECATED] v16 — 本次废弃 |
  | <#White>       </> | 无标记 — 已有组件 |
endlegend

' ── Application ──
Application_Component(browser, "Browser")
Application_Component(vue, "Vue Frontend")
Application_Component(gw, "task-gateway\nAPISIX :18081")
Application_Component(be, "saas-backend\nDjango :8001")

' ── Technology ──
Technology_Node(edge, "Edge nginx\n(daydaymoney / IP / …)")
Technology_Node(vite, "Vite :4000\n(+ /api proxy)")

note right of edge
  [NEW v16] 每入口同构：
  / → Vue
  /api/ → gateway
  Host + X-Forwarded-Proto
  @author: claude @2026-07-11 17:26
end note

note top of vue
  [MODIFIED v16]
  API_BASE_URL 默认 ''
  请求同源 /api/...
  @author: claude @2026-07-11 17:26
end note

note bottom of vite
  [MODIFIED v16]
  server.proxy /api → gateway
  （直连 :4000 兜底）
end note

Application_Component(absApi, "绝对 http://IP:18081\nAPI 基址")
note top of absApi
  [DEPRECATED v16]
  HTTPS 入口下触发 Mixed Content
  @author: claude @2026-07-11 17:26
end note

Rel_Flow(browser, edge, "HTTPS/HTTP 任意入口")
Rel_Flow(edge, vite, "/ 静态与 HMR")
Rel_Flow(edge, gw, "/api/ 同源反代")
Rel_Flow(vite, gw, "dev proxy /api")
Rel_Flow(gw, be, "上游 API")
Rel_Flow(browser, absApi, "🔴 废弃路径")

@enduml
